  ('home.your_numbers', 'home_cards', 'Your numbers', 'computed', 'shows', 'live', null, null, null, null, '["debt_rows","invested_total","cash_rows","spending"]'::jsonb, '["player"]'::jsonb, null, '{"stage":"any","step_number":null,"shown_if":"A placed player."}'::jsonb, '"Four tiles: the lead number (for example Debt-free date), FI progress or Savings rate, Net worth, Months of cushion. Each says Guess, Close or Exact, and \"typical\" when it runs on a typical value. A tap opens the metric."'::jsonb, '{"file":"game/features/results.js","lines":"520","raw":"game/features/results.js:520"}'::jsonb, '"A typical value is greyed and tagged \"typical\"."'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '["screen.keynums"]'::jsonb, null, 640, true, 'Home', 'Results cards'),
