  ('stg.score', 'moves', 'About what is your credit score?', 'tap_single', 'asks', 'live', 'low', null, 'A rough band is enough. Most bank and card apps show it for free. The card vault reads the same answer.', 'One question first', '["x_about"]'::jsonb, '["player"]'::jsonb, '["Under 580","580 to 669","670 to 739","740 to 799","800 or more","I don''t know it"]'::jsonb, '{"stage":"any","step_number":null,"shown_if":"Asked once, for every move that needs it (\"N questions left\")."}'::jsonb, '"Chips. One tap answers each move that asks the same thing. \"I don''t know it\" is kept as unsure, never a No."'::jsonb, '{"file":"game/data/strategies.js","lines":"65","raw":"game/data/strategies.js:65"}'::jsonb, null, '[]'::jsonb, '["screen.stratlib"]'::jsonb, 'facts points at the store of Moves to try (c.x.about). A fact that setup owns is read from the profile instead.', 6770, true, 'Next Steps', 'Moves to try'),
